      "content": {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 14,
                "offset": 25,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "19sf0",
            "text": "WorkBuddy 每天签到只有 100 积分。 本期方法论提示词在文章结尾。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 0,
                "length": 15,
                "offset": 7
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 3,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "efptk",
            "text": "btw，我发现 WorkBuddy 成长计划建议先点进去一下，后面随便用用就能有积分可以领，或者特意做任务。不过这个看个人需求，同时现阶段Hy3是限免的，如果用Hy3倒也不消耗积分。",
            "type": "blockquote"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "4veql",
            "text": "如果让 WorkBuddy 自己每天跑一次美团自动领券，积分会继续被消耗。领券本身又是一个很小、很固定的任务，用掉这些积分多少有点可惜。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 7,
                "offset": 11,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "57ses",
            "text": "所以我做了一次很轻量的本地能力借用。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "e8dtd",
            "text": "WorkBuddy 美团生活助手\n├─ 借给 Codex：每天 10:45 自动领券\n└─ 借给 Hermes：在微信里查餐厅、做推荐",
            "type": "blockquote"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "ct18i",
            "text": "这里的“借”非常重要。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "adphi",
            "text": "Codex 和 Hermes 都没有独立接入美团。真正的能力来自 WorkBuddy 与美团的专项合作，我只是让自己电脑里的另外两个 AI 助手，在限定权限下调用它。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "3il3",
            "text": "先说清楚：这项能力来自哪里？",
            "type": "header-two"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "1j534",
            "text": "美团生活助手是美团与 WorkBuddy 的 B2B 专项合作能力。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "41hae",
            "text": "从业务结构看，它属于双方打通的 CPS/AI 渠道：美团为 WorkBuddy 配置了专属 AI 场景，WorkBuddy 用户还可以领取专享券包。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 1,
                "length": 6,
                "offset": 51
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "1rq8o",
            "text": "公开报道也提到，美团为 WorkBuddy 用户准备了面额更优的专属券，并支持找团购、领券和定时领取。相关合作报道",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "esom2",
            "text": "这套能力并不是面向普通开发者公开下载的美团 CLI。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "eph6f",
            "text": "所以，如果没有安装 WorkBuddy、没有添加并真正使用过“美团生活助手”，本文的方法暂时无法复现。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "4900s",
            "text": "更准确的关系是：",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "7c4nj",
            "text": "美团与 WorkBuddy 打通能力\n→ WorkBuddy 在本机安装美团生活助手\n→ Codex 和 Hermes 借用这项本地能力",
            "type": "blockquote"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "fea8q",
            "text": "合作中的渠道参数、场景配置、认证信息和账号凭证都不应公开。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "90j9a",
            "text": "CLI 到底是什么？",
            "type": "header-two"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "amhgd",
            "text": "WorkBuddy 里的美团生活助手，表面上是一个可以对话的 AI 专家。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "21s14",
            "text": "拆开后主要是两部分：",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "4s8uk",
            "text": "操作说明：告诉 AI 什么时候调用什么能力\n本地 CLI：真正执行登录、领券、定位和搜索",
            "type": "blockquote"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "746hc",
            "text": "CLI 可以理解为一组电脑终端命令。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 2,
                "length": 18,
                "offset": 72
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "2d283",
            "text": "WorkBuddy 官方文档也将 Skill 描述为“可执行脚本与工作流”，并把 `Skill + CLI` 列为连接第三方服务的一种技术形式。WorkBuddy Skill 文档",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "9aghh",
            "text": "我没有复制美团接口，也没有重新开发一套服务。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "25ntu",
            "text": "我只是让 Codex 和 Hermes 调用这台电脑上已经存在的 WorkBuddy CLI。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "59oh9",
            "text": "为什么强调“本地能力借用”？",
            "type": "header-two"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "3677d",
            "text": "这次改造只发生在同一位用户、同一台电脑里：",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "8jjh6",
            "text": "不抓包；",
            "type": "unordered-list-item"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "52off",
            "text": "不逆向美团 App；",
            "type": "unordered-list-item"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "424a2",
            "text": "不爬取美团网页；",
            "type": "unordered-list-item"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "5v4g2",
            "text": "不绕过登录；",
            "type": "unordered-list-item"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "anojm",
            "text": "不复制或公开 Token；",
            "type": "unordered-list-item"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "9r853",
            "text": "不重新发布 WorkBuddy 插件；",
            "type": "unordered-list-item"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "2khm9",
            "text": "不提供给其他用户或账号使用。",
            "type": "unordered-list-item"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "4g90b",
            "text": "登录凭证仍然留在 WorkBuddy 原来的本地凭证区。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "aer6a",
            "text": "Codex 和 Hermes 只能知道“当前是否已经登录”，不会读取或显示真实 Token、Cookie 和设备凭证。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "660c9",
            "text": "因此，这项实践的边界应该明确写成：",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "6aebi",
            "text": "“仅做个人本机编排，不代表获得公开 API 或对外分发授权”。",
            "type": "blockquote"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "27t9o",
            "text": "把 Skill 文件单独复制给别人也没有用。没有 WorkBuddy 原始插件、专项场景配置和本机登录状态，Skill 只是一份操作说明。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "fn9o1",
            "text": "基于 WorkBuddy 的美团能力，我制作了两套 Skill",
            "type": "header-two"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "6nosq",
            "text": "两套 Skill 的权限不同：",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 3,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "cve56",
            "text": " ",
            "type": "atomic"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "bnt03",
            "text": "为什么不让它们共用一套？",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "dgn06",
            "text": "因为 Codex 的自动任务非常确定：",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "9k4at",
            "text": "每天 10:45，只领一次券。",
            "type": "blockquote"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "94b77",
            "text": "而 Hermes 长期待在微信里，收到的通常是模糊自然语言：",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "frv3e",
            "text": "“这个好像不错。”",
            "type": "unordered-list-item"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "f1m0q",
            "text": "“附近有什么吃的？”",
            "type": "unordered-list-item"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "6017i",
            "text": "“明天去湖滨银泰附近，推荐一下。”",
            "type": "unordered-list-item"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "tmhi",
            "text": "“帮我看看哪家划算。”",
            "type": "unordered-list-item"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "2r7v7",
            "text": "这些表达并不等于授权领券或下单。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "5uc1c",
            "text": "与其只靠提示词提醒 Hermes 小心，不如直接从代码层拿掉这些权限。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "bqaam",
            "text": "第一套用法：Codex 每天自动领券",
            "type": "header-two"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "56u93",
            "text": "Codex 版本由两部分组成：",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "8d30o",
            "text": "Codex Skill\n＋\n美团安全适配器",
            "type": "blockquote"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "7lf1n",
            "text": "安全适配器负责：",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "7pan3",
            "text": "调用 WorkBuddy 美团 CLI；",
            "type": "unordered-list-item"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "ftl9b",
            "text": "检查上游版本和文件指纹；",
            "type": "unordered-list-item"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "cu2q9",
            "text": "隐藏 Token、Cookie 和设备信息；",
            "type": "unordered-list-item"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "cu8uj",
            "text": "关闭 AI 自动支付；",
            "type": "unordered-list-item"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "do3gq",
            "text": "限制自动任务只能调用领券命令。",
            "type": "unordered-list-item"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "f2ame",
            "text": "正式设置自动化前，我先手动完成三次检查：",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "7lqkm",
            "text": "检查本地环境\n→ 演练领券但不实际执行\n→ 手动完成一次真实领券",
            "type": "blockquote"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "a861",
            "text": "确认能稳定返回优惠券后，才创建每天 10:45 的自动任务。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "ftnr",
            "text": "任务还遵守三条规则：",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "477i3",
